      "id": "exam/edexcel-9fm0-01-sample/q8",
      "question": "<p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x-2}{4}=\\dfrac{y-4}{-2}=\\dfrac{z+6}{1}\"></span></p><p>The plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span> has equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x-2y+z=6\"></span></p><p>The line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_2\"></span> is the reflection of the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_1\"></span> in the plane <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\Pi\"></span>.</p><p>Find a vector equation of the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l_2\"></span> <span class=\"marks\">(7)</span></p>",
